(527173, 52295, 7810, '<td valign="top">nice...I can smell the sewage lagoon at the trailer park now...well done</td>', 'nice...I can smell the sewage lagoon at the trailer park now...well done', '2003-12-31 10:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(527174, 52672, 14614, '<td valign="top">WOW - that''s some decoration!  I''d zoom in on the cows to avoid the lights in the background (distractin) and the wasted space on the sides.  Good tacky shot nonetheless</td>', 'WOW - that''s some decoration!  I''d zoom in on the cows to avoid the lights in the background (distractin) and the wasted space on the sides.  Good tacky shot nonetheless', '2003-12-31 10:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(527175, 52880, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: yep, fits the challenge! Exposure composition focus lighting all good, though I might have thrown some black cloth over the red surface the angel is on. The red is a bit distracting.<br/> <br/>Personal: Wow, that''s tacky.<br/> <br/>My vote: 8</td>', 'Technical: yep, fits the challenge! Exposure composition focus lighting all good, though I might have thrown some black cloth over the red surface the angel is on. The red is a bit distracting. Personal: Wow, that''s tacky. My vote: 8', '2003-12-31 10:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(527178, 52551, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all pretty good- would a night shot of this been more interesting to look at?<br/> <br/>Personal: Is this California? ;-)<br/> <br/>My vote: 7</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all pretty good- would a night shot of this been more interesting to look at? Personal: Is this California? ;-) My vote: 7', '2003-12-31 10:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(527179, 52578, 3649, '<td valign="top">I don''t know - IS it a Christmas present? Looks like one to me. Tacky, tho? Never :) Seems a little flat in all but her legs and the background to right especially is a little busy. Maybe bring the darkest areas down to a true black and play with the curves a bit to get a more dramatic effect. Nice shot.</td>', 'I don''t know - IS it a Christmas present? Looks like one to me. Tacky, tho? Never :) Seems a little flat in all but her legs and the background to right especially is a little busy. Maybe bring the darkest areas down to a true black and play with the curves a bit to get a more dramatic effect. Nice shot.', '2003-12-31 10:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(527180, 52579, 14614, '<td valign="top">That''s tacky!  The background detracts from the shot - well, detracts isn''t the right word since Santa''s pretty detracting himself ;)</td>', 'That''s tacky!  The background detracts from the shot - well, detracts isn''t the right word since Santa''s pretty detracting himself ;)', '2003-12-31 10:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(527182, 52590, 14614, '<td valign="top">Can''t exactly tell what I''m looking at</td>', 'Can''t exactly tell what I''m looking at', '2003-12-31 10:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(527183, 52345, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with a winter wonderland in the background</td>', 'Nice composition with a winter wonderland in the background', '2003-12-31 10:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(527184, 52674, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure relatively good, composition good,  focus is off- a tripod would have helped perhaps. Lighting good.<br/> <br/>Personal: gotta have sharper focus!<br/> <br/>My vote: 4</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure relatively good, composition good,  focus is off- a tripod would have helped perhaps. Lighting good. Personal: gotta have sharper focus! My vote: 4', '2003-12-31 10:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(527186, 52265, 14614, '<td valign="top">Looks homemade AND tacky.  Shiny apple in background and lights in lower right are distracting.</td>', 'Looks homemade AND tacky.  Shiny apple in background and lights in lower right are distracting.', '2003-12-31 10:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(527188, 52572, 3649, '<td valign="top">Leave it to starbucks. Tacky tacky tacky. Tho those thermoses are pretty elegant... Nice composition, I''d like to see a color difference between the background and the thermos wrap and - if possible - wiping down the reflective surfaces so that the fingerprints aren''t so distracting. Seems like a slightly noisy photo, too (high ISO setting?). Good eye.</td>', 'Leave it to starbucks. Tacky tacky tacky. Tho those thermoses are pretty elegant... Nice composition, I''d like to see a color difference between the background and the thermos wrap and - if possible - wiping down the reflective surfaces so that the fingerprints aren''t so distracting. Seems like a slightly noisy photo, too (high ISO setting?). Good eye.', '2003-12-31 10:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(527190, 52861, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure pretty good. Composition is weak- the inclusion of the blinds makes this an obvious snapshot- more effort and better placement would have made a stronger photo. Focus and lighting good.<br/> <br/>Personal: Just because the theme is tacky doesn''t mean the photography should suffer! :-)<br/> <br/>My vote: 4</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure pretty good. Composition is weak- the inclusion of the blinds makes this an obvious snapshot- more effort and better placement would have made a stronger photo. Focus and lighting good. Personal: Just because the theme is tacky doesn''t mean the photography should suffer! :-) My vote: 4', '2003-12-31 10:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(527191, 52808, 14477, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed</td>', 'A little overexposed', '2003-12-31 10:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(527193, 52890, 14614, '<td valign="top">Had to call my family in to see this one -- WOW tacky is right.Well lit and composed.</td>', 'Had to call my family in to see this one -- WOW tacky is right.Well lit and composed.', '2003-12-31 10:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(527195, 52496, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition lighting all good! As for focus, I would have liked a longer DOF so that everything was sharp.<br/> <br/>Personal: Great title! <br/> <br/>My vote: 8</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition lighting all good! As for focus, I would have liked a longer DOF so that everything was sharp. Personal: Great title!  My vote: 8', '2003-12-31 10:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(527196, 52376, 14614, '<td valign="top">Yikes, those eyes!  I''d prefer not cutting off the bottom.</td>', 'Yikes, those eyes!  I''d prefer not cutting off the bottom.', '2003-12-31 10:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(527197, 52369, 9939, '<td valign="top">Not tacky, not in focus.<br/> <br/>My vote: 1</td>', 'Not tacky, not in focus. My vote: 1', '2003-12-31 10:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(527198, 52407, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of the best night shots of the "overdecorated house" theme</td>', 'One of the best night shots of the "overdecorated house" theme', '2003-12-31 10:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(527199, 52399, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Looks overexposed. Composition good, focus looks off- the branches just to the left of the can look sharp. A longer DOF might have helped. Lighting good but exposure makes it look too bright.<br/> <br/>Personal: Good idea, needs more effort!<br/> <br/>My vote: 4</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Looks overexposed. Composition good, focus looks off- the branches just to the left of the can look sharp. A longer DOF might have helped. Lighting good but exposure makes it look too bright. Personal: Good idea, needs more effort! My vote: 4', '2003-12-31 10:46:46.000000', NULL, 1);
