(527207, 52306, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: yep, fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good.<br/> <br/>Personal: nicely done.<br/> <br/>My vote: 7</td>', 'Technical: yep, fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good. Personal: nicely done. My vote: 7', '2003-12-31 10:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(527209, 52578, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure/lighting is rather uneven. In some cases this works but here I think it''s too off balance. I think the composition leaves something to be desired, another angle might have been more interesting and attractive. Focus is obviously on the right leg/ornament, but with this composition it''s a little too narrow for me. The black and whiteis interesting but it looks like there is a lot of artifacting- either that or the patterns on her legs, crotch and on the floor are just very distracting.<br/> <br/>Personal: Good idea, but more time, softer more even lighting and different angles might have yielded a stronger, more interesting shot. <br/> <br/>My vote: 4</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure/lighting is rather uneven. In some cases this works but here I think it''s too off balance. I think the composition leaves something to be desired, another angle might have been more interesting and attractive. Focus is obviously on the right leg/ornament, but with this composition it''s a little too narrow for me. The black and whiteis interesting but it looks like there is a lot of artifacting- either that or the patterns on her legs, crotch and on the floor are just very distracting. Personal: Good idea, but more time, softer more even lighting and different angles might have yielded a stronger, more interesting shot.  My vote: 4', '2003-12-31 10:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
