(527292, 52282, 12733, '<td valign="top">Yeah, he''s a pretty tacky Santa. I like the colors and the contrast with his face and beard, but these could have been a lighter gray, IMHO.</td>', 'Yeah, he''s a pretty tacky Santa. I like the colors and the contrast with his face and beard, but these could have been a lighter gray, IMHO.', '2003-12-31 11:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(527293, 52761, 6668, '<td valign="top">nice shot, I''m not sure I would cosider it to be tacky, but what one person considers tacky may differ from another persons point of view. I like the black around the window, it really makes the star stand out. 8</td>', 'nice shot, I''m not sure I would cosider it to be tacky, but what one person considers tacky may differ from another persons point of view. I like the black around the window, it really makes the star stand out. 8', '2003-12-31 11:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
