(527299, 52759, 6668, '<td valign="top">seems a little dark around santa''s face, I like the lights in the rest of the shot, they put off a nice pastel glow.</td>', 'seems a little dark around santa''s face, I like the lights in the rest of the shot, they put off a nice pastel glow.', '2003-12-31 12:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(527300, 52919, 12733, '<td valign="top">Sponge Bob is tacky enough, and the background is soft enough to make him stand out. A little more green in the branch in the foreground might have been nice.</td>', 'Sponge Bob is tacky enough, and the background is soft enough to make him stand out. A little more green in the branch in the foreground might have been nice.', '2003-12-31 12:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(527303, 52288, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute idea to use marshmallows to make the snowman. Surely your creativity could have extended to a way to hang him. The hand in the photo ruins the illusion and contrasts badly with the desaturated tree needles.</td>', 'Cute idea to use marshmallows to make the snowman. Surely your creativity could have extended to a way to hang him. The hand in the photo ruins the illusion and contrasts badly with the desaturated tree needles.', '2003-12-31 12:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(527306, 52572, 12733, '<td valign="top">These are too pretty to be tacky. I''m not sure what the significance of the jugs in the foreground is, but to me it doesn''t really explain the sense of tacky and it does take away from the colors and metallic textures of the decorations. IMHO if the point is that metal trees are inherently tacky, the tree limbs should have been more prominent.</td>', 'These are too pretty to be tacky. I''m not sure what the significance of the jugs in the foreground is, but to me it doesn''t really explain the sense of tacky and it does take away from the colors and metallic textures of the decorations. IMHO if the point is that metal trees are inherently tacky, the tree limbs should have been more prominent.', '2003-12-31 12:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(527308, 52551, 6668, '<td valign="top">LOL...that certainly is tacky...but I think the shot would have been better at night with the lights on.</td>', 'LOL...that certainly is tacky...but I think the shot would have been better at night with the lights on.', '2003-12-31 12:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(527311, 52573, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty photo. Is this a lighted decoration on display outdoors or something smaller. The lack of scale makes me keep looking at it and in the process appreciating the variety of shades and details.</td>', 'Very pretty photo. Is this a lighted decoration on display outdoors or something smaller. The lack of scale makes me keep looking at it and in the process appreciating the variety of shades and details.', '2003-12-31 12:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(527312, 52386, 10145, '<td valign="top">Lots of irony here...I like the shot.</td>', 'Lots of irony here...I like the shot.', '2003-12-31 12:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
