(527596, 52792, 8054, '<td valign="top">This image could have used a bit of adjustment from levels as there is no true black (especially for a night shot).</td>', 'This image could have used a bit of adjustment from levels as there is no true black (especially for a night shot).', '2003-12-31 16:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
