(527601, 52771, 10858, '<td valign="top">Hey, Nature is too wonderful to be tacky!<br/>I like your DOF and the falling snow flakes here.</td>', 'Hey, Nature is too wonderful to be tacky!I like your DOF and the falling snow flakes here.', '2003-12-31 16:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(527603, 52585, 5044, '<td valign="top">Somebody call the fire dept. It''s gonna blow!</td>', 'Somebody call the fire dept. It''s gonna blow!', '2003-12-31 16:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(527604, 52869, 10858, '<td valign="top">Crop is tight for my taste on the top and the bottom, but yes, this is what I call tacky. :-) A plastic snowman... actually I hate plastic stuffs. And without snow this makes me grin. :-) At last a good example that shows you don''t have to make the photo itself tacky to represent tackiness. Good work.</td>', 'Crop is tight for my taste on the top and the bottom, but yes, this is what I call tacky. :-) A plastic snowman... actually I hate plastic stuffs. And without snow this makes me grin. :-) At last a good example that shows you don''t have to make the photo itself tacky to represent tackiness. Good work.', '2003-12-31 16:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(527606, 52655, 10858, '<td valign="top">Strange composition, she looks more like falling down than sitting. I think crop is too tight thought and the picture in the background distracts me a bit (the shadow of the wings, too).</td>', 'Strange composition, she looks more like falling down than sitting. I think crop is too tight thought and the picture in the background distracts me a bit (the shadow of the wings, too).', '2003-12-31 16:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(527609, 52841, 10858, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this would be tacky, as I said before, I don''t think nature''s work would be tacky at all. I like the photo and it being B&amp;W, The thing that distracts me is the shadow and the tip of the cone could be more in focus.</td>', 'I don''t think this would be tacky, as I said before, I don''t think nature''s work would be tacky at all. I like the photo and it being B&W, The thing that distracts me is the shadow and the tip of the cone could be more in focus.', '2003-12-31 16:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(527614, 52918, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good lord...what the?! Although I''m not a fan of the composition, I award extra credit to the extreme tackiness.  :)</td>', 'Good lord...what the?! Although I''m not a fan of the composition, I award extra credit to the extreme tackiness.  :)', '2003-12-31 16:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(527617, 52923, 10858, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit grainy and I wouldn''t have cropped it so tight on the bottom. Otherwise I like the idea very much, it''s great! A lightbulb earring even for a Xmas party... too much for me. :-))) Composition is great, and colours, too.</td>', 'It''s a bit grainy and I wouldn''t have cropped it so tight on the bottom. Otherwise I like the idea very much, it''s great! A lightbulb earring even for a Xmas party... too much for me. :-))) Composition is great, and colours, too.', '2003-12-31 16:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(527618, 52205, 8054, '<td valign="top">And this was someone''s idea of decorating? I like the motion shot of the "ferris wheel" and the "merry-go-round". Well done.</td>', 'And this was someone''s idea of decorating? I like the motion shot of the "ferris wheel" and the "merry-go-round". Well done.', '2003-12-31 16:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(527634, 52274, 8054, '<td valign="top">Looks like the image is either out of focus or you used too much compression. Despite that, the costume is WAY tacky.</td>', 'Looks like the image is either out of focus or you used too much compression. Despite that, the costume is WAY tacky.', '2003-12-31 17:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(527637, 52345, 8054, '<td valign="top">Tacky but it suffers from poor color correction.</td>', 'Tacky but it suffers from poor color correction.', '2003-12-31 17:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(527638, 52738, 8054, '<td valign="top">What the heck are those things?! They look like gallon milk containers with lights. If so, that''s  just, umm, weird. Good composition, though I would have cropped out more of the top and the left side.</td>', 'What the heck are those things?! They look like gallon milk containers with lights. If so, that''s  just, umm, weird. Good composition, though I would have cropped out more of the top and the left side.', '2003-12-31 17:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(527640, 52572, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice image although it''s unfortunate the metallic surfaces have too many fingerprints. Lighting seems a bit bright, too. Overall good image.</td>', 'Nice image although it''s unfortunate the metallic surfaces have too many fingerprints. Lighting seems a bit bright, too. Overall good image.', '2003-12-31 17:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
