(530145, 52575, 12733, '<td valign="top">I think the blur was a nice idea, but it''s too much. The face should be reasonably sharp even if the rest of the photo isn''t. Really nice try at a great concept.</td>', 'I think the blur was a nice idea, but it''s too much. The face should be reasonably sharp even if the rest of the photo isn''t. Really nice try at a great concept.', '2004-01-02 22:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(530147, 52923, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting concept, and the photo is clear and sharp. Did someone make the light into an earring, or did it come that way?</td>', 'This is an interesting concept, and the photo is clear and sharp. Did someone make the light into an earring, or did it come that way?', '2004-01-02 22:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(530150, 52407, 12733, '<td valign="top">Imagine their electric bill! I don''t think I''ve evr seen lights on the roof like this. Nicely captured, but I think a little overexposed; the house should be more shaded to contrast with the lights.</td>', 'Imagine their electric bill! I don''t think I''ve evr seen lights on the roof like this. Nicely captured, but I think a little overexposed; the house should be more shaded to contrast with the lights.', '2004-01-02 22:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(530153, 52626, 12733, '<td valign="top">A Christmas cactus??? The composition is nice, except for the brownish object in the left foreground. What is it? Could a change in angle or a tighter crop eliminate it?</td>', 'A Christmas cactus??? The composition is nice, except for the brownish object in the left foreground. What is it? Could a change in angle or a tighter crop eliminate it?', '2004-01-02 22:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(530155, 52880, 12733, '<td valign="top">Definitely icky. Is the body lighted from inside? Was this "angel" made for the purpose of being photographed or was this someone''s real idea of a decoration?</td>', 'Definitely icky. Is the body lighted from inside? Was this "angel" made for the purpose of being photographed or was this someone''s real idea of a decoration?', '2004-01-02 22:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(530157, 52352, 142, '<td valign="top">It was just a matter of time before somebody thought to do this.</td>', 'It was just a matter of time before somebody thought to do this.', '2004-01-02 22:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(530158, 52847, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is it a tree or a circular staircase? The lack of a recognizable object to give it scale makes this a very mysterious shot - and the DOF is excellent.</td>', 'Is it a tree or a circular staircase? The lack of a recognizable object to give it scale makes this a very mysterious shot - and the DOF is excellent.', '2004-01-02 22:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
