(530165, 52295, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting construction - is it really what it appears to be - lettuce, round cereals or small doughtnuts and licorice? Or is it a plastic replica. Was it made just to be photographed? I like the composition and overall effect, but I think the lighting falls off a bit to much on the left.</td>', 'An interesting construction - is it really what it appears to be - lettuce, round cereals or small doughtnuts and licorice? Or is it a plastic replica. Was it made just to be photographed? I like the composition and overall effect, but I think the lighting falls off a bit to much on the left.', '2004-01-02 23:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(530167, 52861, 12733, '<td valign="top">The internal lighting and colors are great. This would be really outstanding if it were against a totally black background with a low enough ambiant light to make the internal lights the only light source in the picture.</td>', 'The internal lighting and colors are great. This would be really outstanding if it were against a totally black background with a low enough ambiant light to make the internal lights the only light source in the picture.', '2004-01-02 23:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(530170, 52352, 12733, '<td valign="top">You''re kidding! Did people really put these in their yard, or was it a setup for the photo? Getting the light from inside the reindeer is attractive, but couldn''t the wires have been hidden better?</td>', 'You''re kidding! Did people really put these in their yard, or was it a setup for the photo? Getting the light from inside the reindeer is attractive, but couldn''t the wires have been hidden better?', '2004-01-02 23:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(530172, 52761, 12733, '<td valign="top">The star and reflections make a nice composition, but I think the overall picture would have been stornger with less of the unlighted portion of the window at the bottom.</td>', 'The star and reflections make a nice composition, but I think the overall picture would have been stornger with less of the unlighted portion of the window at the bottom.', '2004-01-02 23:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(530174, 52584, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the ashtray and the colored liquid in the glass. This is an interesting concept, and well photogrpahed.</td>', 'Nice lighting on the ashtray and the colored liquid in the glass. This is an interesting concept, and well photogrpahed.', '2004-01-02 23:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(530188, 52923, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice shot and a good compositional idea, but it is suffering from some technical flaws. There is a lot of noise in the shot and some annoying vertical lines right by the earlobe.  It would have also been better to take more care with the hair, to remove the stray strands that are in front of and behind the bulb earring.  The earring itself is somewhat crowded in the frame, with the tip almost touching the bottom of the image.  I''m not sure about the crop - I like the earlobe, but not the cut off ear hole. I would have liked to have seen either the whole ear or just the lobe. All in all, it is a pretty cool shot, but could have been improved.</td>', 'nice shot and a good compositional idea, but it is suffering from some technical flaws. There is a lot of noise in the shot and some annoying vertical lines right by the earlobe.  It would have also been better to take more care with the hair, to remove the stray strands that are in front of and behind the bulb earring.  The earring itself is somewhat crowded in the frame, with the tip almost touching the bottom of the image.  I''m not sure about the crop - I like the earlobe, but not the cut off ear hole. I would have liked to have seen either the whole ear or just the lobe. All in all, it is a pretty cool shot, but could have been improved.', '2004-01-02 23:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(530191, 52570, 8624, '<td valign="top">kind of a boring picture, but it made me laugh and fits the challenge very well. I like that the home owner was spirited enough to duct tape up a holiday message, but couldn''t be bothered enough to make it any more festive.</td>', 'kind of a boring picture, but it made me laugh and fits the challenge very well. I like that the home owner was spirited enough to duct tape up a holiday message, but couldn''t be bothered enough to make it any more festive.', '2004-01-02 23:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
