(533877, 52801, 8891, '<td valign="top">I tried to get a place like this down  the street from my Mom''s. But it''s a corner property and there is a cyclone fence all the way around....and the homeowners seem to always be at the front door...guess he was paranoid about having his house in the challenge!LOLQ  Love the total tackiness of this!  Great. My night shots suck for the most part, so this is wonderful by me. Like the composition and all the colors!  Great!</td>', 'I tried to get a place like this down  the street from my Mom''s. But it''s a corner property and there is a cyclone fence all the way around....and the homeowners seem to always be at the front door...guess he was paranoid about having his house in the challenge!LOLQ  Love the total tackiness of this!  Great. My night shots suck for the most part, so this is wonderful by me. Like the composition and all the colors!  Great!', '2004-01-06 22:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(533878, 52653, 8891, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure...great colors withougt being overblown anywhere within reason....this is an amazing amount of lights of different brightness and color and it is as if I can see every single bulb. Great detail....what puts it over the top for me are the names on the roof and the reindeer and sled atop same.  Great work!</td>', 'Perfect exposure...great colors withougt being overblown anywhere within reason....this is an amazing amount of lights of different brightness and color and it is as if I can see every single bulb. Great detail....what puts it over the top for me are the names on the roof and the reindeer and sled atop same.  Great work!', '2004-01-06 22:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
