(534361, 52584, 3306, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for your comments. I was having a hard time with this theme until my wife and I went to an antique flea market. I was looking for something tacky and this was the perfect place for it! I saw several things that caught my eye but when I saw the Santa dish inspiration struck! Its actually a candy dish but I thought it would make an excellent ashtray. I don''t smoke or drink so I had to buy a pack of cigarettes and use apple juice for the glass. I took the picture outside on the deck because frankly the cigarettes can really smell! This was a fun challenge. Thanks again for your critiques.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for your comments. I was having a hard time with this theme until my wife and I went to an antique flea market. I was looking for something tacky and this was the perfect place for it! I saw several things that caught my eye but when I saw the Santa dish inspiration struck! Its actually a candy dish but I thought it would make an excellent ashtray. I don''t smoke or drink so I had to buy a pack of cigarettes and use apple juice for the glass. I took the picture outside on the deck because frankly the cigarettes can really smell! This was a fun challenge. Thanks again for your critiques.', '2004-01-07 07:12:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(534419, 52583, 3306, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a great picture. My dog Zack loved it. He was a little jealous expecially since his picture in the Motivational challenge did not do as well!</td>', 'Congratulations on a great picture. My dog Zack loved it. He was a little jealous expecially since his picture in the Motivational challenge did not do as well!', '2004-01-07 08:20:28.000000', NULL, 0),
