(534573, 52913, 14614, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments.  This is my second challenge and I really am enjoying the challenge of each theme.<br/> <br/>I had the "misfortune" of taking an interesting shot of a tacky decoration of a lovely subject.  I know that generated mixed emotions for some (me included -- on top of all that this was a gift!)  The item, unlit, is a two-sided flimsy balsa wood cut out.  It has lights in between the two pieces of wood and if you saw it in real life you''d know why I felt it fit the category.</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments.  This is my second challenge and I really am enjoying the challenge of each theme. I had the "misfortune" of taking an interesting shot of a tacky decoration of a lovely subject.  I know that generated mixed emotions for some (me included -- on top of all that this was a gift!)  The item, unlit, is a two-sided flimsy balsa wood cut out.  It has lights in between the two pieces of wood and if you saw it in real life you''d know why I felt it fit the category.', '2004-01-07 10:29:45.000000', NULL, 0),
